{"timestamp":"2026-08-06T03:11:08.156Z","type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"function_call_output","id":"fco_019fd50d-a17c-7881-8c2e-cce2a30655e3","call_id":"call_rDopv7FFvloLo7GdNUIbXBbI","output":"{\"agents\":[{\"agent_name\":\"/root\",\"agent_status\":\"running\"},{\"agent_name\":\"/root/branch_gate_audit_1_27\",\"agent_status\":\"running\"},{\"agent_name\":\"/root/branch_gate_audit_28_54\",\"agent_status\":\"running\"},{\"agent_name\":\"/root/branch_gate_audit_55_81\",\"agent_status\":\"running\"},{\"agent_name\":\"/root/complete_manifest\",\"agent_status\":\"running\"},{\"agent_name\":\"/root/event_discovery_templates/final_source_audit\",\"agent_status\":{\"completed\":\"Core source behavior is clean for authorization, tenant isolation, direct-link outcomes, template structure, and announcement targeting.\\n\\nOne confirmed defect remains:\\n\\n- `events:viewPublic` is still presented as a configurable permission in `src/shared/permissions/permissions.ts`, but no runtime path enforces it. Remove this misleading no-op permission and its seed/test references.\\n\\nStack caveat:\\n\\n- The discovery commit removes `unlisted` and old listing permissions while Playwright/generated-documentation sources still reference them. The planned replacement patch must directly follow or be folded into that slice; otherwise intermediate PRs are not independently full-suite compliant.\\n\\nAll patches satisfy review limits: 3/23/34/33 files and 100/113/740/1,242 changed lines.\\n\\nRemaining proof gaps are PostgreSQL-backed discovery/role-transition checks and Browser/Playwright verification of direct-link and announcement journeys.\"}},{\"agent_name\":\"/root/final_verification_matrix\",\"agent_status\":{\"completed\":\"Direct spawning initially failed at the thread limit, so three idle workers were reassigned successfully. The UI assembler then completed all three groups directly on the exact rebased branch, so duplicate work was stopped.\\n\\nCurrent authoritative state:\\n\\n- 23 stale assertions corrected in spec files only.\\n- Formatting and lint completed.\\n- Full 966-test Angular run is in progress.\\n- I made no file, ref, container, or remote changes.\"}},{\"agent_name\":\"/root/stack_ui_test_layers\",\"agent_status\":\"running\"},{\"agent_name\":\"/root/stack_ui_test_layers/align_admin_copy_tests\",\"agent_status\":{\"completed\":\"Admin-copy assertion patch completed.\\n\\n- Patch: `/tmp/evorto-admin-copy-tests.mEvBaH/align-admin-copy-tests.patch`\\n- SHA-256: `e951dca17f762cc11ffa8b8fdeea78f5973be4be53302e15f302b27a2942b991`\\n- Scope: 5 files, +10/−11\\n- Focused Angular: 5 files, 54/54 tests passed\\n- Formatting and lint passed\\n- Applies cleanly to current tip `49a33e367888b204ec14b17d7c81be018cbb492e`\\n- No implementation changes; all seven failures were stale copy assertions.\"}}]}","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"019fd2d8-aa27-7b33-9da1-34e7e79b653d"}}}
