{"timestamp":"2026-08-06T05:19:38.057Z","type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"function_call_output","id":"fco_019fd583-4649-7db0-a58f-cd354a7fb871","call_id":"call_ai3Rm45fP4qtumfryzfpy5ts","output":"{\"agents\":[{\"agent_name\":\"/root\",\"agent_status\":\"running\"},{\"agent_name\":\"/root/branch_gate_audit_1_27\",\"agent_status\":\"running\"},{\"agent_name\":\"/root/branch_gate_audit_28_54\",\"agent_status\":\"running\"},{\"agent_name\":\"/root/branch_gate_audit_55_81\",\"agent_status\":\"running\"},{\"agent_name\":\"/root/branch_gate_audit_55_81/audit_64_72\",\"agent_status\":\"interrupted\"},{\"agent_name\":\"/root/branch_gate_audit_55_81/audit_73_81\",\"agent_status\":\"interrupted\"},{\"agent_name\":\"/root/complete_manifest\",\"agent_status\":\"running\"},{\"agent_name\":\"/root/event_discovery_templates/final_source_audit\",\"agent_status\":{\"completed\":\"Core source behavior is clean for authorization, tenant isolation, direct-link outcomes, template structure, and announcement targeting.\\n\\nOne confirmed defect remains:\\n\\n- `events:viewPublic` is still presented as a configurable permission in `src/shared/permissions/permissions.ts`, but no runtime path enforces it. Remove this misleading no-op permission and its seed/test references.\\n\\nStack caveat:\\n\\n- The discovery commit removes `unlisted` and old listing permissions while Playwright/generated-documentation sources still reference them. The planned replacement patch must directly follow or be folded into that slice; otherwise intermediate PRs are not independently full-suite compliant.\\n\\nAll patches satisfy review limits: 3/23/34/33 files and 100/113/740/1,242 changed lines.\\n\\nRemaining proof gaps are PostgreSQL-backed discovery/role-transition checks and Browser/Playwright verification of direct-link and announcement journeys.\"}},{\"agent_name\":\"/root/stack_ui_test_layers\",\"agent_status\":{\"completed\":\"Completed the final 12-layer UI/docs/test series.\\n\\n- Artifact: `/tmp/evorto-ui-final-audit-fallback.s9ZtLK`\\n- Manifest: `/tmp/evorto-ui-final-audit-fallback.s9ZtLK/MANIFEST.md`\\n- Parent: `d47f6ec9cee2cdbbdc05187286994dd08d007936`\\n- Head: `42824a7e1ac4e2fb35ea44b2f5840b2095547e81`\\n- Final tree: `4c55b1f629b60d2c4603ff6d2168ec24a1f026eb`\\n\\nAll 12 patches replay cleanly. Every layer is below 100 files and 1,500 changed lines; the widest is 83 files and the largest is 1,400 lines.\\n\\nValidation passed:\\n\\n- Angular: 966/966\\n- Server: 1,497/1,497\\n- Application build\\n- Formatting and lint\\n- Diff and forbidden-term scans\\n- No active skipped/fixme tests\\n- Clean worktree\\n\\nThe ordered, collision-checked branch names are recorded in the manifest and have been sent to the coordinator. No shared refs, remotes, Docker state, or workspace files were mutated.\"}}]}","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"019fd2d8-aa27-7b33-9da1-34e7e79b653d"}}}
